      en: ["Sugar Loaf Mountain stands at an elevation of about 730 meters.", "It is located near the historic mountain village of Regent.", "The mountain is a critical water source for the Guma Valley Reservoir.", "Geologically, it is part of the Western Area gabbro intrusive complex.", "A major mudslide in August 2017 caused hundreds of fatalities.", "It is protected within the Western Area Peninsular National Park."],
